CHANGES MADE TO THE ORIGINAL (required by CC BY 4.0 section 3(a)(1)(B)):

  1. Subsetting. 2,117 of 251,734 cases were selected, by the rank of
     sha256("matchbook-bpic19-snapshot-v1" + case_id) within each Item
     Category stratum, allocated proportionally with a floor of 120 cases per
     stratum. See SAMPLE.md and sample-manifest.json; logs/sample.py
     reproduces the selection exactly.
  2. Format conversion. IEEE-XES XML to CSV, gzipped, split into an event
     file and a case-attribute file.
  3. Monetary representation. "Cumulative net worth (EUR)" is carried as
     integer cents in value_cents. Values in the original are anonymised by a
     linear translation and are not real currency.
  4. Event order preserved. The source file's own event order is retained, so
     the effect of any later tie-breaking assumption remains measurable.

NO FIELD VALUE WAS ALTERED. The subset is a selection and a re-encoding, not
a modification of the data itself.

The attribution above must travel with any further redistribution of these
files or of data derived from them.
